      "text": "The model shows that tBregs can cause the tumour to reach its carrying capacity even if NK cell activity is high, provided tBreg numbers are sufficient."
    },
    {
      "quote": "a potential tBreg-depleting therapy could minimise the ability of breast cancer to grow and metastasise.",
      "text": "The results suggest that depleting tBregs could reduce breast cancer growth and metastasis."
