  "mechanism": "The model posits that breast cancer cells induce the activation of tBregs, which in turn activate Tregs. These Tregs suppress NK cells, which are responsible for killing the cancer cells. This creates a feedback loop where the tumour promotes its own survival by suppressing the immune response.",
